OL,3,GNEWSARestoring the 'hidden little gem'
OL,4,Aof canal tunnels
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngineers will use a combination of
OL,7,Ftraditional methods and modern
OL,8,Ftechnology to repair one of England's
OL,9,Foldest canal tunnels.
OL,11,FPreparations have begun ahead of work
OL,12,Fstarting on the Preston Brook tunnel
OL,13,Fwhich is on the Trent and Mersey Canal
OL,14,Fin Cheshire.
OL,16,FThe Canal and River Trust is
OL,17,Fundertaking the detailed inspection
OL,18,Fusing both traditional hands-on
OL,19,Finspections alongside 3D mapping and
OL,20,Fdrone footage.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
