OL,3,GNEWSARestoring the 'hidden little gem'
OL,4,Aof canal tunnels
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeter Simpson, principle engineer for
OL,7,Ftunnels and culverts at the trust, said
OL,8,Fthe biggest challenge is gaining the
OL,9,F"knowledge and understanding" of the
OL,10,Fcondition of the tunnel before any
OL,11,Frepair work can begin.
